 "show_help", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "show_help"}], "size": [505.148193359375, 375.2469787597656], "pos": [-1790.5635986328125, 2498.416259765625], "widgets_values": ["Rewrite the input studio portrait of this young adult East Asian woman into a vertical photorealistic full-body portrait in a nostalgic Taiwanese idol-drama register, rendered with an early-2000s analog flash photography aesthetic of soft highlight bloom, gentle halation, dreamy background blur, visible film grain and fine sensor noise. Keep her facial identity fully unchanged, preserving the shapes of her eyes, nose and lips, her facial proportions and her fair complexion, while transforming everything around her: restyle her hair into a short pink bob with blunt bangs framing her face, replace her original thin-strap top with a fitted red qipao carrying a subtle floral jacquard texture, complete the outfit with matching red high heels, and set her expression to a cool rebellious gaze directed straight into the camera lens. She stands head-to-toe inside the frame at the entrance of a nostalgic Taiwanese snack shop, her figure built at a natural adult head-to-body ratio so the complete body from crown to heels reads correctly proportioned within the doorway, captured from a low-angle wide-lens perspective that elongates her legs while keeping the anatomy realistic. Both arms extend straight toward the lens in a precise C-BLOCK gesture, her hands close to the camera yet proportionate to her body: the left hand sits higher with palm inward, its index and middle fingers held together pointing upward and its thumb extended sideways, while the right hand sits lower with palm inward, its index and middle fingers held together pointing downward and its thumb extended sideways crossing beside the left thumb; every finger stays straight, natural and clearly readable under retained flash exposure, her face remaining fully visible between and above the two hands. The shop entrance surrounds her with worn storefront textures of a weathered plaster wall, painted wooden door frames and a low concrete step, crowned by vintage Chinese signage: a vertical dark-green board beside the doorway bears the faded gold traditional characters \"歡迎光臨\" stacked from top to bottom, and a red enamel sign mounted above the entrance carries the bold white brush-style type \"美味小吃\" set in one horizontal row; inside the shop behind her, a warm incandescent glow pools over wooden shelves and spills forward onto her silhouette. The lighting contrasts the cool-toned direct flash illumination on her skin with the warm storefront glow of the background, her red heels planting firmly on the concrete step with a crisp contact shadow beneath them. Render the entire image in that early-2000s film snapshot mood with soft bloom around the bright flash highlights on her face and arms, gentle halation bleeding from the warm bulbs behind her, fine grain and sensor noise across the frame, balancing nostalgic warmth against modern rebellious energy."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {}, "id": 497, "type": "CR Prompt Text", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt Text"}, "order": 15}], "extra": {"VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "ue_links": [], "pixaromaGroups": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "VHS_latentpreviewrate": 0, "frontendVersion": "1.53.6", "VHS_latentpreview": false, "ds": {"offset": [1912.659810085543, -2247.6840236689122], "scale": 0.6303940863128492}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 38, "title": "Models", "bounding": [-678.7581176757812, 2352.13525390625, 530, 590]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 39, "title": "Image Size", "bounding": [-661.0130004882812, 2958.78173828125, 530, 250]}, {"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id"